 "text": "Your goal has no date, that's why it's not moving. GetFit sounds like a goal, but there's nothing to check. No number, no deadline, so every week feels the same. Rewrite it with a number and a date. GetFit becomes Run 5k by March 1st. Now you can count. That's 18 weeks from today and this week has a job. 3 easy runs, 20 minutes each. Same with reading. Read more becomes 12 books by December 31st. That's one book a month. Here's the test. If you can't tell whether this week was on track, the goal still needs a number or a date. That's what Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down into small steps you can actually do. If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio.",
